  "interpretation": "OPA-Tool independently reproduces task-level tool-name allowlist decisions. On the call-ready frozen slice it can observe only tool-set mismatches; it does not receive event-source, task-admission, approval, grant-lifecycle, or cross-layer evidence state. This isolates protection-object coverage rather than ranking the OPA engine against the E2AG architecture. No latency comparison is reported."
